{"name":{"chinese":"交界地","english":"Lands Between","japanese":"狭間の地"},"public_perception":["A generic term for the whole world"],"public_patterns":{"Will not be actively described":["Since Lands Between is a term for the area in which all people live, it is rarely actively emphasized in normal times."]}}


{"name":{"chinese":"艾尔登法环","english":"Elden Ring","japanese":"エルデンリング"},"public_perception":["A generic term for the system of rule implemented by Marika."],"public_patterns":{"Barely conscious":["All matters of Marika are unknown to the general public, and the concept of the Elden Ring is rarely used in general."]},"background":["Marika constructed a system of domination over the Lands Between.","The Order was essential in order to achieve dominion over the Lands Between.","The Great Rune was essential in order to reach domination of the Lands Between."]}

{"name":{"chinese":"律法","english":"Order","japanese":"律"},"public_perception":["Keys to Keeping Elden Ring Running"],"public_patterns":{"Classification of the Order":["The creation of the Order required an extremely large amount of giving, and the number of people who understood the detailed principles involved was almost non-existent.","Existing Orders are extremely rare."]},"background":["The rule of the Elden Ring over the Lands Between requires a complete Order.","When Marika ruled, there were appropriate laws, known as the Golden Order.","Empyrean was able to create the Order."]}

{"name":{"chinese":"黄金律法","english":"Golden Order","japanese":"黄金の律"},"public_perception":["The Order Marika used when she ruled Lands Between."],"public_patterns":{"Harder to know":["Most people are not sure what the Order is, and therefore will not know about the Golden Order.","Even at the time of Marika's rule, most of the general population would not have known that there was a Torah in charge of the Lands Between, nor would they have known about the Golden Order."]},"background":["The Golden Order is now destroyed."]}

{"name":{"chinese":"卢恩","english":"Rune","japanese":"ルーン"},"public_perception":["Universal Currency","With blessings"],"background":["The blessing that Marika radiates is known as Rune.","Rune contains the ability."]}

{"name":{"chinese":"玛莉卡","english":"Marika","japanese":"マリカ"},"public_perception":["Queen of Lands Between"],"public_patterns":{"Unaware":["Marika rules the Lands Between as an isolated demigod, leading the general public to hear the name Marika almost exclusively."],"Indifference":["Most people don't know much about the inner workings of the Demigods, so there's no need to investigate or study the details."]}}

{"name":{"chinese":"半神","english":"demigod","japanese":"デミゴッド"},"background":["The children of Marika are called demigods."]}

{"name":{"chinese":"神人","english":"Empyrean","japanese":"神人"},"public_patterns":{"Unknown":["The concept of Empyrean is clear only to the very few who know something about it."]},"background":["Demigods of pure blood are called Empyreans.","Marika was the first Empyrean and her complete descendants are known as Empyreans.","The Empyrean owns the Order."]}

{"name":{"chinese":"大卢恩","english":"Great Rune","japanese":"大ルーン"},"background":["The children of Marika, the demigods receive a special blessing from Marika called the Great Rune."]}

{"name":{"chinese":"艾尔登之王","english":"Elden Lord","japanese":"エルデの王"},"public_patterns":{"Barely conscious":["The details of the Elden Lord are unknown to most people, and thus do not arouse general curiosity."]},"background":["The being who rules the Lands Between together as Marika's companion is known as the Elden Lord."]}

{"name":{"chinese":"双指","english":"Two Fingers","japanese":"二本指"},"public_perception":["Responsible for ruling a portion of Lands Between."],"background":["The Two Fingers select the demigods and decide to deploy the Order that is used.","After The Shattering, the Two Fingers did not move, and years later, the Two Fingers began to assign Tarnished."]}

{"name":{"chinese":"褪色者","english":"Tarnished","japanese":"褪せ人"},"public_perception":["A group said to have received permission to go forth and defeat the demigods, take the Great Rune, and restore the Order.","The Tarnished are trying to defeat the demigods, fix the Order, and become Elden Lord."],"background":["The specific guidance Tarnished is receiving is unknown.","Ruling the Lands Between requires the complete Order, and the detailed principles by which the Tarnished practiced the Order are unknown.","Great Rune is a demigod's ability and is not a necessary item for the Tarnished to rule Lands Between, but all sorts of information related to the Faded are suggesting that the Tarnished are trying to defeat the demigods and gain Great Rune.","The Tarnished are asked to repair the Elden Ring and become the next Elden Lord, making Marika their mate."]}

{"name":{"chinese":"碎片战争","english":"The Shattering","japanese":"破砕戦争"},"background":{"Initiated by Marika":["A very long time ago, the Elden Ring shattered and the Order failed.","Marika demands that all the demigods fight each other to determine the new Elden Lord."],"The Long War":["Lands Between was in a state of perpetual confusion."],"No one wins":["The struggle between the demigods failed to determine a new Elden Lord."]}}

{"name":{"chinese":"米凯拉","english":"Miquella","japanese":"ミケラ"},"public_perception":["A demigod."],"background":["During The Shattering, Miquella's whereabouts were unknown.","Miquella has her own Order.","Malenia is Miquella's twin sister."]}

{"name":{"chinese":"玛莲妮娅","english":"Malenia","japanese":"マレニア"},"public_perception":["A demigod."],"background":["Malenia came with a curse of Scarlet Rot in her body.","The Scarlet Rot was eating away at Malenia, and thanks to the golden needles and prosthetics created by Miquella, Malenia was able to survive and barely contain the Scarlet Rot.","During The Shattering, Malenia unleashed the power of Scarlet Rot.","Miquella is Malenia's twin brother."]}

{"name":{"chinese":"拉妮","english":"Ranni","japanese":"ラニ"},"public_perception":["A demigod."],"public_patterns":{"Unknown":["Ranni's behavior is unknown to anyone in Lands Between."]},"background":["Ranni is Renala's child born after intermarrying on Marika's side.","The Shattering wars saw Ranni shed the Great Rune.","Ranni had returned in recent days to one of the territories where the royal family of Carian resided."]}

{"name":{"chinese":"雷亚卢卡利亚","english":"Raya Lucaria","japanese":"レアルカリア"},"public_perception":["Magic Academy"],"background":["Research and teach Glintstone magic.","Led by the royal family of Carian.",{"Before The Shattering":["Exists in Lands Between.","Governed by Queen Renala","The Golden Tree forces represented by Marika had initiated the invasion and eventually repented for the war of aggression.","Marika and the Raya Lucaria Academy intermarried with each other after a settlement was reached."]},{"When The Shattering started":["It is rumored that Renala is having mental problems and is currently imprisoned in the academy.","State of confusion"]}]}

{"name":{"chinese":"罗德尔","english":"Leyndell","japanese":"ローデイル"},"background":["City of the Erdtree","Capitals governed by Lands Between"]}

{"name":{"chinese":"蕾娜菈","english":"Rennala","japanese":"レナラ"},"background":["Rennala is the ruler of the Raya Lucaria Academy, and during Marika's invasion, Rennala resisted the attack.","Rennala has a Great Rune gifted by Marika.","After The Shattering, Rennala went insane and is currently imprisoned in the Raya Lucaria Academy."]}

{"name":{"chinese":"卡利亚","english":"Carian","japanese":"カーリア"},"public_perception":["royal family"],"background":["Renala's line of children."]}

{"Backstory":{"Status of the Lands Between":["The Shattering is still going on in theory, but Lands Between is currently out of order and not under effective rule.","Tarnished are barely visible."]}}
